{"hw":"ὁρμέω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ὁρμέω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ὁρμέω</span>, (<span class=\"gk\">ὅρμος</span> II) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be moored, lie at anchor,</b> of a ship, <span class=\"gk\">ἐν Ἐλαιοῦντι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.22</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πρὸς γῇ</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">188</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀκταῖσιν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Or.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">55</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐν λιμένι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.52</span> </span>; opp. <span class=\"gk\">μετέωρος ὁ.,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.26</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οὗ ναῦς ὁρμεῖ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IT</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1043</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐνταῦθα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">35.29</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">κατὰ τὴν Κύρου σκηνήν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.4.3</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">πρόκροσσαι ὁρμέοντο ἐς πόντον</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">moored themselves, came to anchor,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.188</span> </span> codd. (<span class=\"gk\">ὅρμεον τὸ</span> is prob. cj.). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> prov. phrases, <span class=\"gk\">ἐπὶ δυοῖν ἀγκύραιν ὁ.,</span> etc., v. ἄγκυρα: metaph., <span class=\"gk\">ἐπὶ σμικροῖς μέγας ὁ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OC</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">148</span> </span> (anap.); <span class=\"gk\">ἐπὶ τῆς ἐκείνων ἀρετῆς ὁ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aristid.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.134</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">J.</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐπὶ τῆς ποιητικῆς δυνάμεως</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Luc.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Dem. Enc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18</span> </span>.</div></div>"}